{"projectInfo":{"name":"IRF冗余主备配置","path":"hcl_reth","visibility":2,"categoryId":155,"introduction":"2台防火墙堆叠，通过Reth1口（冗余口）和上行交换机SW1互联，下行两个三层口和MSR对接，正常情况下业务由MSR的G0/1口上到FW1处理，当FW1故障时业务切换至FW2处理。其中，防火墙G1/0/2口地址为10.10.1.1/24，G2/0/2口地址为10.20.1.1/24；MSR G0/1口地址为10.10.1.2/24，G0/2口地址为10.20.1.2/24。","label":[]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"SW1","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S5820V2-54QS-GE","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.075-A7571","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SW1.cfg"},{"resourceName":"FW1","resourceCategory":"防火墙","resourceModel":"F1060","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-A7164","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\FW1.cfg"},{"resourceName":"FW2","resourceCategory":"防火墙","resourceModel":"F1060","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-A7164","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\FW2.cfg"},{"resourceName":"MSR","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\MSR.cfg"}]}